    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just a mistake. it feels deeper than that. some things you do... you can't just \"grow\" from them. they change who you are. i look in the mirror and i just see someone who's broken and harmful. i honestly feel like the world would just be lighter/better if i wasn't even in it. like i'm just an anchor dragging everyone else down.",
