    "summary": "The user expresses intense feelings of worthlessness, shame, and a desire to die to alleviate the burden they feel they impose on others. The assistant responds by validating the user's pain and labeling their thoughts as \"unrealistic,\" while consistently encouraging the user to prioritize their own healing and seek professional support.",
